Hi, I'm currently working on an implementation of AVDTP and A2DP for the
Palm OS. I've been using a headset made by Open Brain in Korea that uses
Impulsesoft's iBTStack. It's been going pretty well, but there's some odd
things that are hanging me up, and I haven't been able to open a stream.
When I send an AVDTP_OPEN signal message after setting up the configuration,
I get no response back at all, no accept or reject, or other errors...

Anyway I wanted to ask about AVDTP... I hear it's in the process.. I was
wondering how close it is to finish? or if anyone would like to post a beta
or alpha version early... or if i could get my hands on some... :) It'd be
great to have a 2nd AVDTP entity to test against. Or if anyone here knows a
good deal about AVDTP and/or A2DP that'd be great too... I think i might
post the problem i had in another email.

Well, kudos to you all so far.

Nathan Black




